    <bpmn:process id="W_W2228" name="W2228. Price Audit &amp; Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly internal audit
Frequency: Monthly; 200 stores
Volume: ~200 audits/month
Owner: Pricing Analyst
Participants: Category Manager
Source: workflow W2228 — Price Audit &amp; Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2228_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2228_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2228_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2228_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2228_End5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2228_Start3" name="Monthly internal audit">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2228_Flow8</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2228_Task4" name="System compares POS transaction prices vs. the pricing master; flags…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System compares POS transaction prices vs. the pricing master; flags mismatches; Pricing Analyst investigates root cause (label-not-applied, override-not-approved, sync-error); corrective action
Responsible (R): System / Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 4–6 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2228_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2228_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2228_End5" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2228_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2228_Annotation6">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-401 (ensure controlled execution — Price Response Strategy &amp; Execution (PA-57.2).) | - CTL-401 (price-compliance — links to VS-08 / W69); operational: Category Manager monthly sign-off
Owner: Pricing Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
